{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-08-16T03:33:32.816Z","sessionId":"ae412d01-e061-4047-918b-0d1df3d4d118","content":"<task-notification>\n<task-id>a45aded0180cc9e34</task-id>\n<tool-use-id>REDACTED</tool-use-id>\n<output-file>/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-gabe-Projects-callisto/5e79b5c6-5688-4728-8d81-ff2c106a0e2e/tasks/a45aded0180cc9e34.output</output-file>\n<status>completed</status>\n<summary>Agent \"Implement TASK-32 (AC-14 pnpm malformed-input slice)\" finished</summary>\n<note>A task-notification fires each time this agent stops with no live background children of its own. The user can send it another message and resume it, so the same task-id may notify more than once.</note>\n<result>## Summary\n\nTASK-32 executed exactly as planned, with one correction: the plan's AC-11 fixture block omitted the root `package.json` file, which would have made that sub-block test AC-06b (file-absent) instead of AC-11's actual criterion (root `package.json` present with no `\"workspaces\"` field, alongside malformed pnpm YAML). I fixed the fixture to match AC-11's exact spec text and the fixture already proven by TASK-27 (commit f93e5aa), so the block genuinely proves AC-11 rather than a different, weaker criterion.\n\n**Verification steps taken:**\n1. Confirmed all 27 prior commits present on `ignore_walk.rs`, tree clean, before starting.\n2. Read AC-14, AC-09h, AC-11, AC-11b, AC-11d directly from `.claude/specs/SPEC-TRACK3A-WORKSPACE-MEMBERSHIP.json`.\n3. Cross-checked TASK-32's fixture against prior committed test fixtures (TASK-25/27/28/29) — found and fixed the AC-11 gap described above; AC-09h, AC-11b, AC-11d blocks matched exactly, no other gaps.\n4. Ran the new test — it passed immediately with no implementation change (predicted \"regression-proof\" pattern confirmed).\n5. Adversarially verified non-vacuousness: temporarily changed `membership.rs:275` from `.ok()?` to `.unwrap()` on the YAML parse, confirmed the test panics, then restored the safe form and confirmed green again.\n6. Ran `cargo fmt -p callisto-graph` (no diff), `cargo clippy -p callisto-graph --all-targets -- -D warnings` (clean), and the full `cargo test -p callisto-graph --lib` suite (312/312 pass).\n7. Committed — pre-commit format-check hook passed.\n\n**Files touched:** `/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs` (test only, no implementation change).\n\n```json\n{\n  \"task_id\": \"TASK-32\",\n  \"status\": \"done\",\n  \"steps_completed\": [\n    \"verified 27 prior commits present and tree clean\",\n    \"read AC-14/AC-09h/AC-11/AC-11b/AC-11d from spec file on disk\",\n    \"cross-checked plan fixture against spec text and prior proven fixtures; found and corrected AC-11 block (added required root package.json)\",\n    \"wrote consolidated regression test in ignore_walk.rs\",\n    \"ran test: passed immediately, no red step (regression-proof, as predicted)\",\n    \"adversarially broke read_pnpm_packages's YAML-parse fallback (.ok()? -&gt; .unwrap()), confirmed test panics\",\n    \"restored safe implementation, confirmed test green again\",\n    \"ran cargo fmt (no diff), cargo clippy -D warnings (clean)\",\n    \"ran full callisto-graph lib test suite: 312 passed, 0 failed\",\n    \"committed\"\n  ],\n  \"test_result\": \"pass\",\n  \"commit_sha\": \"c763bc8\",\n  \"criteria_evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"criterion_id\": \"AC-14\",\n      \"test_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/ignore_walk.rs\",\n      \"test_line\": 2048,\n      \"implementation_file\": \"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/crates/callisto-graph/src/locate/membership.rs\",\n      \"implementation_line\": 273\n    }\n  ],\n  \"concerns\": \"TASK-32's plan fixture for the AC-11 sub-block omitted the root package.json write, which would have made that sub-block indistinguishable from AC-06b (file-absent admits-all) rather than genuinely proving AC-11 (file present, workspaces field absent, malformed sibling pnpm YAML). Corrected to match AC-11's exact spec text and the already-proven TASK-27 fixture before committing. No other gaps found in the AC-09h/AC-11b/AC-11d blocks, which matched the plan and spec exactly.\",\n  \"reasoning\": \"Regression-proof task per the established pattern (TASK-07 through TASK-31); no implementation change expected or needed. The only deviation from the plan's literal fixture code was the AC-11 root package.json fix, justified by spec text and prior committed evidence.\"\n}\n```</result>\n<usage><subagent_tokens>97528</subagent_tokens><tool_uses>30</tool_uses><duration_ms>464494</duration_ms></usage>\n</task-notification>"}
